@startuml profiles-layers
' Law for package arrows inside Profiles.
' ArchUnit: PlantUmlArchitectureTest loads this file.
' Stereotype = package identifier ArchUnit matches.

title Profiles layers
skinparam componentStyle rectangle

[domain] <<com.tinder.profiles.domain..>>
[application] <<com.tinder.profiles.application..>>
[api] <<com.tinder.profiles.api..>>
[infrastructure] <<com.tinder.profiles.infrastructure..>>
[config] <<com.tinder.profiles.config..>>

application --> domain
api --> application
infrastructure --> application
infrastructure --> domain
infrastructure --> config
config --> api
config --> application
config --> infrastructure
config --> domain

note bottom of config
  Wiring beans live here.
  Adapters also inject config.props.
  Domain and application must not.
end note

note top of domain
  No Spring / Jakarta / Lombok on types.
  That rule stays in CleanArchitectureTest.
end note

@enduml
